PodCraft (GERBER.MEDIA fork)

PodCraft is a fork of SoundCraft (https://github.com/storytold/soundcraft) under the same
MIT OR Apache-2.0 terms. Desktop and CLI builds for macOS and Linux statically link the LAME MP3
encoder (https://lame.sourceforge.io, via the mp3lame-sys and mp3lame-encoder crates), which is
licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License (LGPL). LAME is only included when the `mp3`
cargo feature is enabled; builds without it (Windows, Web) contain no LGPL code. If you distribute
a binary with MP3 export, you must also offer LAME's source and the means to relink against a
modified LAME (the object files or source of this program, which is available here).
